      "reason": "LG’s November 2 release documents ongoing activity at Pyeongchon 2, and its commercial site confirms 113 Beolmal-ro. This resolves the street-address gap from snapshot 124. The Korean Ministry of Interior and Safety publishes a location-summary dataset under KOGL Type 1, but a reusable official numeric row was not retrieved. A third-party Esri building mirror restricts offline export outside Korea and is not a distributable substitute.",
