      ],
      "reopen_condition": "Obtain the publicly reusable government record for 113 Beolmal-ro, Dongan-gu, reconcile the numeric point to the named facility, and run exact-distance duplicate checks."
    },
    {
      "candidate": "Chunghwa Telecom Taoyuan Fuguo IDC",
      "country_iso_a2": "TW",
      "disposition": "hold_conflicting_site_addresses",
      "reason": "CHT addresses existing Internet service customers at this named commercial facility on September 7. Its facility directions and the signed facility register give different destinations (100 and 218 Fuguo Road). The city records separate doorplates for 100 and 218, about 96 m apart. The operator brochure identifies the commercial campus but omits the numbered street address. The physical host address of the commercial IDC is unresolved.",
